# Walkthrough: 3D Redesign & Realistic Imagery

The redesign of the "YemekSipariş" landing page is now complete. The goal was to achieve a 3D aesthetic and use more realistic food imagery to create a premium user experience.

## Changes Made

### 1. 3D Hero Section
Created a two-column hero layout featuring a hyper-realistic burger. Added a floating animation (`animate-float`) to the image to give it a 3D, "live" feel.

![Hero Section Redesign](file:///C:/Users/Deacjx/.gemini/antigravity/brain/4b244ea2-d55f-4701-8675-b839f5f87537/hero_section_redesign_1774688817059.png)

### 2. Realistic Restaurant Imagery
Replaced placeholder images with professionally generated realistic food photos for Pizza, Sushi, and Desserts.

![Realistic Restaurant Cards](file:///C:/Users/Deacjx/.gemini/antigravity/brain/4b244ea2-d55f-4701-8675-b839f5f87537/restaurant_cards_realistic_1774688830656.png)

### 3. Glassmorphism & Depth
Upgraded the navigation bar and search bar with enhanced `backdrop-filter` effects and deeper `box-shadow` values to create a sense of depth and hierarchy.

### 4. Dark Mode & Multi-language Support
Implemented a premium Dark Mode and English language localization.

````carousel
![Dark Mode (Turkish)](file:///C:/Users/Deacjx/.gemini/antigravity/brain/4b244ea2-d55f-4701-8675-b839f5f87537/dark_mode_turkish_1774689441238.png)
<!-- slide -->
![Dark Mode (English)](file:///C:/Users/Deacjx/.gemini/antigravity/brain/4b244ea2-d55f-4701-8675-b839f5f87537/dark_mode_english_1774689468588.png)
````

- **Dark Mode**: Uses a deep obsidian palette with vibrant orange accents, preserving the 3D aesthetic.
- **English Support**: Complete translation of all UI elements including navbar, hero, categories, and footer.

### 5. Interaction Fixes
Resolved the issue where 'Order Now' buttons became invisible on hover in light mode by correctly configuring Tailwind with the brand's vibrant orange color.

![Button Hover Fix](file:///C:/Users/Deacjx/.gemini/antigravity/brain/4b244ea2-d55f-4701-8675-b839f5f87537/pizza_milano_hover_check_1774691044988.png)

## Validation Results

- **Visual Inspection**: Verified high-fidelity imagery and smooth transitions in the browser.
- **Theme/Lang Toggles**: Confirmed functional toggles in the navbar with instant state updates.
- **Responsiveness**: The grid system adjusts correctly for mobile and desktop views.

